Checkpoint 4 — Propose a fix, then challenge it

Proposed fix (high-level)
- Make the “base and negated base pairing” logic in powsimp more conservative: do not combine bases b and -b into a factor S.NegativeOne unless we have structural/symbolic guarantees (e.g. b is a Symbol or Add, or b is not a plain Number) or the exponent is an integer (in which case sign extraction is safe).
- Practically: replace the conditional
