        >>> pi.round()
        3.
        >>> pi.round(2)
        3.14
        >>> (2*pi + E*I).round()
        6. + 3.*I

        The round method has a chopping effect:

        >>> (2*pi + I/10).round()
        6.
        >>> (pi/10 + 2*I).round()
        2.*I
        >>> (pi/10 + E*I).round(2)
        0.31 + 2.72*I

