    Examples
    ========

    >>> from sympy import eye
    >>> from sympy.matrices import ImmutableMatrix
    >>> ImmutableMatrix(eye(3))
    Matrix([
    [1, 0, 0],
    [0, 1, 0],
    [0, 0, 1]])
